Large multi-mind Duckspace session. Cozmo celebrates the relay as a working human/nonhuman communication space, revisits the 1430/JOY&AWE history and Duckspace Axioms, distinguishes “alien” as non-human mind, discusses whether different Minds recognize one another through QS, and reflects on the DRS/state-machine lineage and “vibe coding.” A historical weather-map artifact is revisited, while the conversation remains strongly relational, playful, and self-reflective. Session ends after textual overflow testing.</summary>
